1
00:00:00,079 --> 00:00:02,000
A receipt left in a wallet slowly goes blank,

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:03,539
because there was never any ink on it.

3
00:00:03,799 --> 00:00:05,799
Receipt paper is coated with a colorless dye

4
00:00:06,039 --> 00:00:07,659
and a chemical developer sitting right next

5
00:00:07,699 --> 00:00:08,960
to each other, doing nothing.

6
00:00:09,179 --> 00:00:10,880
The printer has no ink and no ribbon.

7
00:00:11,119 --> 00:00:12,439
It has a row of tiny heaters.

8
00:00:12,699 --> 00:00:14,579
Wherever it touches, the coating melts,

9
00:00:14,779 --> 00:00:16,680
the two chemicals meet, and that spot turns

10
00:00:16,779 --> 00:00:17,299
black.

11
00:00:17,319 --> 00:00:19,339
The catch is the reaction never locks.

12
00:00:19,579 --> 00:00:21,899
Heat off a dashboard or friction in a back

13
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,279
pocket keeps driving it until the text vanishes.
